From: Keivan Moradi <18602635+k1moradi@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/nouveau: trace ambient BAR2 instmem lifetimes

Add opt-in process-context records for normal NV50 instmem BAR2 mapping
lifetimes and atomic BAR2 reset generations. The IRQ path adds no VMM
walk, allocation, sleeping lock, or MMIO read; reset markers remain a
diagnostic timing perturbation.

Signed-off-by: Keivan Moradi <18602635+k1moradi@users.noreply.github.com>

